    "html": "<p>Two waves are generated at point X and travel to point Y. The distance between X and Y is 600 km and the speed of the first wave is 10 km s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>. The first wave reaches point Y three minutes earlier than the second wave.</p>\n<p>What is the speed of the second wave?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">1.3 km s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">2.5 km s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">3.8 km s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">5.0 km s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
